      "Propagation - Transplanting": ["Seed indoors 6 weeks before transplanting in the garden", "Start indoors from late february to mid-summer", "Start seeds indoors 5-6 weeks before last frost", "Start seeds indoors 6-8 weeks before last frost date", "sow in deep pots in cool, frost-free place", "sow indoors in containers from Feb., transplant early summer", "sow seeds in pots in a greenhouse", "start seeds indoors 8 weeks prior to last frost date"],
