      "When to sow (outdoors)": "10+",
      "When to plant (transplant)": ["1 week after last frost", "10-12 weeks, 1 week after last frost date", "2 weeks after last frost", "2 weeks before last frost", "6 weeks after sowing them in pots", "At last frost date", "When plants are 5 weeks old", "at last frost date"],
      "When to plant (cuttings)": ["early spring or late fall"],
